<title>GERMANY: Union chief re-elected to VW supervisory board.</title>
<headline>Union chief re-elected to VW supervisory board.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of German engineering union IG Metall Klaus Zwickel was on Tuesday re-elected to the supervisory board of carmaker Volkswagen AG, VW's works council said.</p>
<p>Klaus Volkert, head of VW's group works council was also reconfirmed as a board member as were other workers' representatives, the council said.</p>
<p>The vote was taken by 834 delegates from various VW plants.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
